"\n"
"If `quarkus.redis.tcp.proxy-options.host` is set, the `quarkus.redis.tcp.proxy-options.++*++` (and `quarkus.redis.tcp.non-proxy-hosts`) configuration is used and the `quarkus.proxy.++*++` configuration is ignored.\n"
